      "id": "step-6-19df6a",
      "action": "extract",
      "description": "Read the new sub-account's confirmation number",
      "rationale": "The confirmation number span has a stable id within this app version; using it directly since there's no other semantic marker, with an xpath fallback anchored to the adjacent 'Confirmation #:' label text in case the id changes.",
      "target": {
